/// <see cref="McpServerTool.ProtocolTool"/>'s <see cref="Tool.InputSchema"/>. Those parameters are deserialized from the
/// <see cref="JsonElement"/> values in that collection. There are a few exceptions to this:
/// <list type="bullet">
